{"id":"658930","name":"地三鲜","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/658930/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"茄子","amount":"200克"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"100克"}],"sub":[{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"50克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"胡萝卜洗净切成马蹄块。","img":"images/658930/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"土豆洗净切成小块。","img":"images/658930/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放到大碗里辣椒切成小块。","img":"images/658930/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"茄子切半。","img":"images/658930/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切成小块。","img":"images/658930/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"泡在白醋里5分钟。","img":"images/658930/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"洗净沥干水分。","img":"images/658930/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅里放油(稍多些)热后下入茄子翻炒。","img":"images/658930/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"在倒入士豆和胡萝卜加开水。","img":"images/658930/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"自种的祘苗洗净切成小段。","img":"images/658930/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"小火炖。","img":"images/658930/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入祘苗搅匀。","img":"images/658930/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入味极鲜少许加盐搅匀关火。","img":"images/658930/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/658930/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}